    "law": "At either air–glass interface, the normal-incidence power reflectance is R=((1.5-1)/(1.5+1))^2=0.04. Summing the incoherent transmitted beams gives P_trans=P_inc(1-R)^2/(1-R^2)=P_inc(1-R)/(1+R). Thus P_trans=50(0.96/1.04)=46.153846 mW.",
